<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<!-- 链接进 audiocap 二进制（rex.sh 的 ensure_cap：-sectcreate __TEXT __info_plist）。
	     macOS 弹隐私授权框时从这里拿程序名和用途说明；没有用途说明的程序系统根本不弹框。
	     来龙去脉见 audiocap.swift 的「权限：自己负责」一节。 -->
	<key>CFBundleIdentifier</key>
	<string>local.rex.audiocap</string>
	<key>CFBundleName</key>
	<string>rex 录音采集</string>
	<key>CFBundleDisplayName</key>
	<string>rex 录音采集</string>
	<key>CFBundleExecutable</key>
	<string>audiocap</string>
	<key>CFBundleShortVersionString</key>
	<string>1.0</string>
	<key>CFBundleVersion</key>
	<string>1</string>
	<key>CFBundleInfoDictionaryVersion</key>
	<string>6.0</string>
	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>rex 录你说的话（rex、rex both，录音台的「我 + 对方」和「只录我」）。/ rex records your voice (rex, rex both, and &quot;Me + other side&quot; / &quot;Only me&quot; in the Recording Desk).</string>
	<key>NSAudioCaptureUsageDescription</key>
	<string>rex 录电脑放出来的声音（通话里对方的声音），不改输出设备。/ rex records the audio your Mac plays (the other side of a call) without changing the output device.</string>
</dict>
</plist>
